<title>UK: WEAKER US FUTURES PUT NEW DAMPENER ON EURO COTTON.</title>
<headline>WEAKER US FUTURES PUT NEW DAMPENER ON EURO COTTON.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERPOOL 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weaker US futures put a fresh dampener on activity in European cotton that was already subdued by holidays.</p>
<p>Limited buying interest was in African Franc Zone and Mediterranean descriptions. Few offers were noted for customarily popular Central Asian cottons in the absence of fresh business at the principal origins.</p>
</text>
